{"id":35,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ فَاطِرِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ جَاعِلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَةِ رُسُلاً أُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>ل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>نِحَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ م</span>َّثْنَىٰ وَثُلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ثَ وَرُبَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>عَۚ يَزِيدُ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخَلْقِ مَا يَش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُۚ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ ش<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ ق</span>َد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"مَّا يَفْتَحِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ لِل<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّحْمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةٍ ف</span>َلَا مُمْسِكَ لَهَاۖ وَمَا يُمْسِكْ فَلَا مُرْسِلَ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> م<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ِنۢ ب</span>َعْدِهِ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۚۦ</span> وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"يَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>أَيُّهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_w